  for_point id="3": stand

A note on point 3, since the contract forbids prose inside the block: my "stand" rests on B, which is a genuinely complete, self-contained story with a landing beat (local_closure 9). E is closer to a chapter-opener that closes its own single scene (local_closure 8) — it works alone but leans forward into the next installation. So the universal "each top-ranked sample stands fully alone" is stronger than the evidence for E, but it is not true that the top-rankers are mere fragments: the best sample's completeness is real and is precisely what the ranking rewards.
